#: ../../../reference/interfaces/allegro-vcu-interface.md:2
msgid "allegro-vcu interface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/allegro-vcu-interface.md:4
msgid ""
"The `allegro-vcu` interface enables access to the Allegro Video Core Unit, "
"using a kernel module which directly controls hardware on the device."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/allegro-vcu-interface.md:6
msgid ""
"This interface is intended primarily to be used with {ref}`Ubuntu Core <ref-"
"glossary_ubuntu-core>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/allegro-vcu-interface.md:9
msgid "Developer details"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/allegro-vcu-interface.md:11
msgid "**Auto-connect**: no"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/allegro-vcu-interface.md:13
msgid ""
"Xilinx offers IP for their devices to decode/encode video streams, by using "
"`/dev/allegroDecodeIP` and `/dev/allegroIP` devices."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/allegro-vcu-interface.md:15
msgid ""
"These operations should be considered privileged since the driver assumes "
"trusted input, therefore require manual connection."
msgstr ""

